{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14372","headline":"赋得生刍一束 · 郑孺华","name":"赋得生刍一束","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孙弘期射策，长倩赠生刍。\n至洁心将比，忘忧道不孤。\n芝兰方入室，萧艾莫同途。\n馥馥香犹在，青青色更殊。\n芳宁九春歇，薰岂十年无。\n葑菲如堪采，山苗自可逾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑孺华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}